  "description": "The latest addition to Smok’s hugely popular Stick series, the Stick R22 fuses classic pen-style MTL vaping with the power and versatility to enjoy rich, flavoursome sub-ohm vaping thanks to its powerful internal 2000mAh battery, which can be charged in no time at all thanks to a Type-C USB port. As simple and user-friendly as vape kits get, the Sick R22 can be operated by a single fire button, but you can easily adjust your power output with the adjustable dial at the base, climbing through seven different power levels to find the perfect output for your coil and vaping style. The Smok R22 tank completes the all-in-one form factor of the stylish and simple to use Stick R22 pen-style kit, and features a convenient push-to-fit coil system to reduce leaks, and a simple top-fill system for refilling with e-liquid without removing the tank from the device, while clear glass viewing ports make it easy to keep an eye on your e-liquid level. An adjustable airflow ring lets you dial in to your preferred vape intensity. A 510-drip tip connection means you can use any compatible drip tip you like to achieve the look and feel you want from your Smok R22 tank. Compatible with Smok’s RPM coils, the RPM series allows for a wide range of resistances and vaping styles to suit all vapers.",
